    1 │ /* should generate diagnostics */
  > 2 │ crons.hourly("as const", { minuteUTC: 0 } as const, internal.tasks.cleanup);
      │                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^
    3 │ crons.hourly("satisfies", { minuteUTC: 0 } satisfies Schedule, internal.tasks.cleanup);
    4 │ crons.hourly("value as const", { minuteUTC: 0 as const }, internal.tasks.cleanup);
  
  i Many apps receive the most traffic and scheduled work at minute :00, so a job that runs at that time is more likely to hit your app's limits.
  
  i Remove minuteUTC to let Convex pick a minute and spread the runs across the hour, or set it to a minute other than 0.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

